cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite as below."
title: "SINEX TRF Studio"
version: 1.0.0
license: GPL-3.0
date-released: 2026-05-04
authors:
  - family-names: Dossas
    given-names: Gerasimos M.
    affiliation: International Hellenic University
    email: gerasimos.dossas@gmail.com
abstract: >
  SINEX TRF Studio is a PyQt5 desktop application for ingesting, analyzing, and
  visualizing geodetic SINEX (Solution Independent Exchange) files. It parses
  block-structured SINEX content and provides matrix visualization, station
  mapping, normal-equation recovery, datum analysis, and multi-format export.
keywords:
  - geodesy
  - SINEX
  - ITRF
  - covariance matrix
  - normal equations
  - datum analysis
  - station coordinates
